1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,126
Welcome.

2
00:00:01,126 --> 00:00:02,836
So you want
to teach the arts?

3
00:00:02,836 --> 00:00:04,379
That's great.

4
00:00:04,462 --> 00:00:07,007
Teaching the arts is one
of the most impactful

5
00:00:07,007 --> 00:00:08,216
careers you can have.

6
00:00:08,216 --> 00:00:10,051
You're teaching
a subject you love,

7
00:00:10,051 --> 00:00:11,761
You're shaping
how young people see

8
00:00:11,803 --> 00:00:13,722
and engage with the world.

9
00:00:13,722 --> 00:00:15,306
And it's a great time 

10
00:00:15,306 --> 00:00:17,350
to be an arts educator
in California.

11
00:00:17,350 --> 00:00:20,770
And that's because in 2022, voters passed Prop 28,

12
00:00:20,770 --> 00:00:22,856
which is a billion dollars
every year 

13
00:00:22,856 --> 00:00:23,857
for arts education.

14
00:00:23,857 --> 00:00:26,901
And most of that funding is meant to hire new teachers.

15
00:00:26,901 --> 00:00:28,653
California needs
an additional

16
00:00:28,653 --> 00:00:30,864
five thousand
arts educators now.

17
00:00:30,864 --> 00:00:32,365
There are many pathways
to get there,

18
00:00:32,365 --> 00:00:34,784
but we understand
it can be pretty confusing.

19
00:00:34,784 --> 00:00:37,287
This portal is designed
to meet you where you are,

20
00:00:37,287 --> 00:00:38,788
whether you're 
just starting out

21
00:00:38,788 --> 00:00:41,291
or you've been working in your art form for years.

22
00:00:41,291 --> 00:00:42,375
Here's how it works:

23
00:00:42,375 --> 00:00:44,085
we'll ask you a few questions

24
00:00:44,085 --> 00:00:45,170
about your background,

25
00:00:45,170 --> 00:00:47,047
your art form, 
and your goals,

26
00:00:47,047 --> 00:00:49,174
and then we'll point you
towards the pathway

27
00:00:49,174 --> 00:00:50,717
that makes
the most sense for you.

28
00:00:50,717 --> 00:00:52,343
No two journeys
look the same.

29
00:00:52,343 --> 00:00:54,929
So let's start by telling us
a little bit about yourself.
